  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-diff-approval",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-diff-approval)\n[](https://github.com/9087/dsh-diff-approval/actions)\n[)](https://github.com/9087/dsh-diff-approval/actions/workflows/compat.yml)\n[)](https://github.com/9087/dsh-diff-approval/actions/workflows/compat-newer.yml)\n[](https://github.com/9087/dsh-diff-approval/actions/workflows/release.yml)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-diff-approval",
      "text": "A DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin for pending-change review: it automatically tracks every successful `edit`, `write`, and editor (`str_replace_editor`) mutation, folds them into a single pending list in the sidebar where each file's diff can be reviewed and kept/reverted — and it can also import the workspace's version-control repository's local changes (Git / SVN / Perforce) in one click."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-diff-approval",
      "text": "The panel also collapses its review sidebar into a floating card; while floating, each of its four edges — the left sidebar, the header above, the right sidebar, the composer below — can be chosen to be covered (all four is what used to be fullscreen, and covering nothing is a plain floating card)."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-diff-approval",
      "text": "Two entries open it: the row at the sidebar foot, and a button in the Session header's right-hand controls — the cluster the app keeps its own per-session actions in (where \"Download session log\" lives) — so the review stays one click away with the sidebar collapsed or hidden.\n\nThe panel can also dock as a tab in the app's right sidebar:"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ Features",
